{"id":188364331,"author":{"login":"tobixen","id":1536710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzY3MTA=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOIvaCvM4LOjYr","tag_name":"v1.0.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 1.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-12-01T19:18:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T19:28:06Z","published_at":"2024-12-01T19:28:06Z","assets":[],"body":"Version 1.0.0 may still have plenty of rough edges, it's not very well-tested towards the jungle of different CalDAV-servers out there, test coverage is not complete, documentation is a mess - but it works well for the author.\r\n\r\nThe version number comes with a set of promises:\r\n\r\n* Backward compatibility - things that worked under 1.0 should work under 1.x ... and I'm not planning a 2.0-release in the near future.\r\n* Better development practices from now on - usage of separate git-branches when hacking new functionality or fixing bugs, relatively few commits but with good commit messages in the main branch\r\n* All new code should be covered with test code\r\n* `CHANGELOG.md` is to be kept up-to-date at all times","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
